{"id":"9f1d61f3b224069e","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-booleqsys.md","title":"Boolean equation system","display":"df-booleqsys — Boolean equation system","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-booleqsys","aliases":["27-df-booleqsys"],"display":"df-booleqsys — Boolean equation system","depends_on":["[[27-df-solution]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.1 Definitions and Boolean systems","source_printed_pages":"67–71","source_pdf_pages":"91–95","verification_status":"source-framework-checked-explicit-empty-system"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-booleqsys"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-booleqsys</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-booleqsys — Boolean equation system"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed235bccfeff0bde\" href=\"?note=ed235bccfeff0bde\" title=\"27-df-solution\">27-df-solution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.1 Definitions and Boolean systems"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"67–71"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"91–95"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-framework-checked-explicit-empty-system"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 为有限族；单方程零集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed235bccfeff0bde\" href=\"?note=ed235bccfeff0bde\" title=\"27-df-solution\">27-df-solution</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;(f(x)=0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;(f(x)=0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sol}(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\mathcal F),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\emptyset)=\\mathbb B^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sol}(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\mathcal F),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\emptyset)=\\mathbb B^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定元数 n；无下标 Sol(方程族) 是 Sol_n 的局部缩写。采用有环境论域的集合构造，而不是未指定全宇宙的空交；Sol 在函数与方程族这两个类型上的重载由输入类型明确区分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-solution","status":"resolved","id":"ed235bccfeff0bde","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-solution]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-solution","status":"resolved","id":"ed235bccfeff0bde","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 为有限族；单方程零集见 [[27-df-solution]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;(f(x)=0)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sol}(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\mathcal F),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\emptyset)=\\mathbb B^n.","display":true}],"bytes":1291,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-booleqsys|df-booleqsys — Boolean equation system]]"},{"id":"1db381c4fa3bc53e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$(f_i)_{i\\in[m]}\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n^{[m]}$，$\\mathcal F=\\{f_i\\mid i\\in[m]\\}$；$\\mathrm{Sol}_n$ 见 [[27-df-booleqsys]]。有限逐点析取及空析取见 [[27-df-boolop]]。"}],"outgoing":["ed235bccfeff0bde"]}